OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pledges to come close to
OL,4,ASEND target
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior Essex county councillor has
OL,7,Fpledged to get as close as possible to
OL,8,Fthe 20-week target for assessing
OL,9,Fchildren for special educational needs
OL,10,Fand disabilities (SEND).
OL,12,FSam Journet, the Reform UK education
OL,13,Fcabinet member at the local authority,
OL,14,Fsaid that by July 2027, he expected
OL,15,F80-90% of assessments to be completed
OL,16,Fwithin the time frame.
OL,18,FConservative opposition councillor Ross
OL,19,FPlayle described the commitments as
OL,20,F"very lofty".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
